<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#AgreementGovernanceObligation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Agreement Governance Obligation" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#AgreementGovernanceObligation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An obligation to establish, maintain, and comply with formal agreements, including documentation, signing, and adherence to agreed terms." .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#AncillaryFeePattern
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#AncillaryFeePattern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#AncillaryFeePattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#AncillaryFeePattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The term 'AncillaryFee' captures the supplementary nature of these charges across jurisdictions. It avoids jurisdiction-specific terms while encompassing mandatory fees, non-tuition fees, and membership fees as subclasses. The name satisfies the pattern's constraints by being jurisdiction-neutral and a subclass of cco:Resource." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#AncillaryFeePattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ancillary Fee" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#AncillaryFeePattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A fee or charge associated with educational services or institutional requirements that is not directly related to tuition, academic assessments, or qualification awards." .
