# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#AssessmentActionPattern
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#AssessmentActionPattern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#AssessmentActionPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Action> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#AssessmentActionPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name 'AssessmentAction' is derived from the common functional purpose of evaluating competence across all jurisdictions. It maintains jurisdiction neutrality by avoiding program-specific terms and correctly positions as a subclass of cco:Action, satisfying the pattern's requirement to retain CCO hierarchy constraints." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#AssessmentActionPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Assessment Action" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#AssessmentActionPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An action taken to evaluate an individual's knowledge, skills, or competence in an educational or training context." .
