# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalLoanDebtPattern
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalLoanDebtPattern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalLoanDebtPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalLoanDebtPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name 'EducationalLoanDebt' avoids jurisdiction-specific terms while clearly indicating the universal concept of debt from education-related loans. It satisfies the pattern by being a subclass of cco:Resource and ensuring all axioms apply universally across aligned jurisdictions." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalLoanDebtPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Educational Loan Debt" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalLoanDebtPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A financial obligation arising from a loan specifically designated to fund educational pursuits, representing the amount owed by a borrower to a lending institution or government program." .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalOrganizationPattern
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalOrganizationPattern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalOrganizationPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Agent> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalOrganizationPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Organisation> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalOrganizationPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name 'EducationalOrganization' is jurisdiction-neutral, CamelCase, and accurately reflects the universal role of entities in the cluster across education systems. It satisfies the CCO superclass constraint and avoids domain-specific properties not universally applicable." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalOrganizationPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Educational Organization" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalOrganizationPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An organization involved in providing educational programs, qualifications, or training, and may be responsible for administrative functions related to student enrollment, funding, or eligibility." .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalPeriodPattern
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalPeriodPattern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalPeriodPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalPeriodPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name 'EducationalPeriod' combines the core concepts of 'fee period' and 'study period' while remaining jurisdiction-neutral. It satisfies the pattern by being a subclass of cco:Resource, avoiding jurisdiction-specific terms, and capturing the universal concept of a time-bound educational financial framework." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalPeriodPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Educational Period" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalPeriodPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A designated time period associated with an educational program, used for determining financial obligations or support." .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalProgramPattern
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalProgramPattern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
