<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalProgramPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Educational Program" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EducationalProgramPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A structured course of study or training program offered by an educational provider." .
