<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EnrollmentActionPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name 'EnrollmentAction' is jurisdiction-neutral, CamelCase, and captures the universal concept of actions impacting student enrollment status. It satisfies the pattern by avoiding jurisdiction-specific terms and ensuring all subclasses are functionally equivalent under the shared CCO supertype 'Action'." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EnrollmentActionPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Enrollment Action" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EnrollmentActionPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An action that affects a student's enrollment status in an educational institution, including processes such as enrolling, withdrawing, or applying for leave." .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EnrolmentActionPattern
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EnrolmentActionPattern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
