<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EnrolmentActionPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name 'EnrolmentAction' captures the common functional purpose of both aligned classes while avoiding jurisdiction-specific terminology. It maintains compatibility with the cco:Action supertype and satisfies the requirement that all axioms hold universally across jurisdictions." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EnrolmentActionPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Enrolment Action" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#EnrolmentActionPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An action involving the confirmation or reporting of a student's participation in an educational program, regardless of jurisdiction-specific implementation details." .
