<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#JurisdictionalRegulatorPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An agent representing a regulatory authority at the jurisdiction level, responsible for overseeing compliance with regulatory frameworks." .
