# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#LearnerInformationRecordPattern
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#LearnerInformationRecordPattern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#LearnerInformationRecordPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#LearnerInformationRecordPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name 'LearnerInformationRecord' avoids jurisdiction-specific terms while capturing the core purpose of storing structured learner data across contexts. It satisfies the pattern by aligning with the cco:Resource hierarchy and ensuring all axioms apply universally to the cluster members' shared functionality." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#LearnerInformationRecordPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Learner Information Record" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#LearnerInformationRecordPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A data record containing learner-specific information used by educational institutions for administrative, assessment, or protection-related purposes." .
