# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#LoanAdjustmentResourcePattern
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#LoanAdjustmentResourcePattern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#LoanAdjustmentResourcePattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#LoanAdjustmentResourcePattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name 'LoanAdjustmentResource' is CamelCase, jurisdiction-neutral, and reflects the universal concept of loan amount modifications across aligned classes. It satisfies CCO hierarchy constraints by subclassing cco:Resource and avoids domain/range violations by focusing on shared adjustment mechanics rather than jurisdiction-specific programs." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#LoanAdjustmentResourcePattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Loan Adjustment Resource" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#LoanAdjustmentResourcePattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A resource representing an adjustment to a loan amount based on eligibility reassessment or changes in funding parameters, converted from grant excess or increased caps." .
