<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#OrganizationalExecutiveRolePattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name 'OrganizationalExecutiveRole' combines jurisdiction-neutral terms ('Organizational' and 'Executive') to reflect the universal concept of a high-level role responsible for organizational governance or management. It satisfies the pattern's constraints by avoiding jurisdiction-specific vocabulary, maintaining subclassing under cco:Role, and ensuring axioms on the shared class apply universally across aligned jurisdictions." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#OrganizationalExecutiveRolePattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Organizational Executive Role" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#OrganizationalExecutiveRolePattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A role held by an individual who is responsible for the overall governance or executive management of an organization, as defined by applicable legal or regulatory frameworks." .
