# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentAidModificationConditionPattern
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentAidModificationConditionPattern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentAidModificationConditionPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Condition> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentAidModificationConditionPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name 'StudentAidModificationCondition' avoids jurisdiction-specific terms while capturing the universal concept of a condition affecting financial aid. It satisfies the pattern by maintaining compatibility with the cco:Condition supertype and ensuring all axioms apply universally to both withdrawal/deferral and appeal scenarios." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentAidModificationConditionPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Student Aid Modification Condition" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentAidModificationConditionPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A condition that triggers a change in a student's financial aid status due to enrollment adjustments or administrative review processes." .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentEnrollmentPattern
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentEnrollmentPattern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentEnrollmentPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentEnrollmentPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name 'StudentEnrollment' is jurisdiction-neutral, combining the core concepts of 'Course Load' and 'Student Enrolment' while avoiding region-specific terminology. It maintains compatibility with the cco:Resource supertype and ensures all axioms apply universally across aligned jurisdictions." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentEnrollmentPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Student Enrollment" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentEnrollmentPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The formal registration of a student in one or more academic courses or programs during a specified period, representing their participation status and course commitments." .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentGrievanceMechanismPattern
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentGrievanceMechanismPattern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentGrievanceMechanismPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentGrievanceMechanismPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name 'StudentGrievanceMechanism' combines the universal concept of student-initiated dispute resolution ('Grievance') with the neutral term 'Mechanism' to encompass both procedural and form-based implementations. It avoids jurisdiction-specific terms while maintaining alignment with the CCO:Resource hierarchy and satisfying cross-jurisdictional axiom constraints." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentGrievanceMechanismPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Student Grievance Mechanism" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentGrievanceMechanismPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A formal process or form used by students to initiate or resolve complaints or appeals regarding academic or administrative matters within an educational institution." .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentProceduralResourcePattern
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentProceduralResourcePattern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentProceduralResourcePattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentProceduralResourcePattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name 'StudentProceduralResource' combines the universal scope ('Student'), the functional purpose ('Procedural'), and the CCO hierarchy ('Resource'). It avoids jurisdiction-specific terms while capturing the common theme of structured processes or information required of students, satisfying all pattern constraints and review criteria." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentProceduralResourcePattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Student Procedural Resource" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentProceduralResourcePattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A resource representing processes, procedures, or information required for student compliance with enrollment, verification, or documentation requirements across educational contexts." .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentRolePattern
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentRolePattern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
