<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentRolePattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Student Role" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#StudentRolePattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A role held by an individual enrolled in or applying for an educational program, encompassing variations in dependency status, enrollment status, and program-specific eligibility across jurisdictions." .
