<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#TaxRegulatoryAuthorityAgentPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name 'TaxRegulatoryAuthorityAgent' reflects the universal function of tax administration and enforcement shared by the aligned classes (IRS, ATO) while maintaining jurisdiction neutrality. It directly extends the confirmed CCO supertype 'RegulatoryAuthorityAgent' and avoids any jurisdiction-specific terminology." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#TaxRegulatoryAuthorityAgentPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Tax Regulatory Authority Agent" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#TaxRegulatoryAuthorityAgentPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A regulatory authority agent responsible for tax collection, administration, and enforcement of tax-related laws within a jurisdiction." .
