<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#TotalProgramCostPattern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#TotalProgramCostPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#TotalProgramCostPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name 'TotalProgramCost' is jurisdiction-neutral, avoiding specific terms like 'tuition' or 'training' while capturing the universal concept of aggregated program expenses. It satisfies the pattern by being a subclass of cco:Resource and ensuring all axioms apply universally across aligned jurisdictions." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#TotalProgramCostPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Total Program Cost" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#TotalProgramCostPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The total cost of an educational or training program, including tuition, training, and any associated assessments or fees incurred to date." .
