<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#TrainingProviderOrEmployerPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name 'TrainingProviderOrEmployer' captures the dual role of entities across jurisdictions as either training service providers or employers involved in training partnerships. It avoids jurisdiction-specific terms and aligns with the confirmed CCO supertype 'Organisation', satisfying all pattern constraints." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#TrainingProviderOrEmployerPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Training Provider or Employer" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#TrainingProviderOrEmployerPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An organization that either provides training services or is an employer engaged in training arrangements with educational institutions or training providers." .
