<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#FederalFixedStudentContribution> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The federal fixed student contribution, a calculated amount based on study weeks and capped at 34 2/3 weeks per loan year." .
