<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#NonPunitiveWithdrawalForm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#AcademicWithdrawalResourcePattern> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#NonPunitiveWithdrawalForm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#NonPunitiveWithdrawalForm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Non-Punitive Withdrawal Form" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#NonPunitiveWithdrawalForm> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A form used to report non-punitive withdrawals from a study period to StudentAid BC." .
