<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#PartTimeStudent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "For part-time, the student must successfully complete all courses for which their Canada Student Financial Assistance Program funding was issued. If the student is studying at 20% of a full-time course load and drops their only course, this is considered a withdrawal." .
