<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#ScholasticStandingRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A student has met the scholastic standing requirement if the post-secondary institution indicates the student has maintained a satisfactory scholastic standard based on the standards and expectations of that institution and/or if a course credit was granted. This is not dependent on the student meeting the post-secondary institution’s grade point average." .
