<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#StudentSupportServices> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#TitleIVAid> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#StudentSupportServices> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Assistive services (tutors, interpreters, academic planning), accommodation services (exam writing), and access to and administration of student financial assistance (grants, bursaries) provided under a centralized institution support program." .
