<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#WithdrawnStudent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Students are considered to have withdrawn if they transfer to a new post-secondary institution and there is a gap of more than two weeks between the last date of attendance at the first post-secondary institution and the first date of attendance at the second post-secondary institution." .
