# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticeWorkingHoursCondition
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticeWorkingHoursCondition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticeWorkingHoursCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Condition> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticeWorkingHoursCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Apprentice Working Hours Condition" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticeWorkingHoursCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A condition where the apprentice works fewer than 30 hours a week or has a zero-hours contract at the beginning of the apprenticeship." .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticesNeedingLearningSupport
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticesNeedingLearningSupport> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticesNeedingLearningSupport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Role> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticesNeedingLearningSupport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Apprentices Needing Learning Support" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticesNeedingLearningSupport> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Has a learning difficulty or disability as defined in Section 15ZA(6) of the Education Act 1996 (as amended by section 41 of the Apprenticeships, Skills, Children and Learning Act 2009), who, as a result of this learning difficulty or disability, requires reasonable adjustments in order to be able to complete their apprenticeship, including any reasonable adjustments to complete English and / or maths requirements (this includes where apprentices have opted-in – see paragraph 46) and end-point assessment." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticesNeedingLearningSupport> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00123> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#Apprenticeship
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#Apprenticeship> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#Apprenticeship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Action> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#Apprenticeship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#Apprenticeship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Apprenticeship" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#Apprenticeship> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A DfE funded apprenticeship program." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#Apprenticeship> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A structured training program combining work and study, leading to a recognized qualification." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#Apprenticeship> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A structured training program combining work and study, regulated under UK apprenticeship rules." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#Apprenticeship> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A structured training programme combining work and study, leading to a recognised qualification." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#Apprenticeship> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A system of training a new generation of practitioners of a trade or profession with on-the-job training and often some accompanying study." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#Apprenticeship> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Accelerated Note added / amended definitions of the following terms: apprenticeship, Active learning, Adult Skills Fund, Apprenticeship service record, Apprenticeship Technical Funding Guide, Care leavers’ bursary, Complete early, Employer incentive payments, End-point assessment, Final day, Foundation apprenticeship, Gateway requirements, (The) Institute, New provider status (APAR), Off-the-job training, On-programme End-point Assessment, Person of significant control, Prior learning, Prison leaver, Published typical duration, Summary of training document, Total negotiated price (TNP)." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#Apprenticeship> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An apprenticeship is a job with training. Through an apprenticeship, an apprentice will gain the technical knowledge, practical experience and wider skills and behaviours that they need to be competent in their immediate job and future career." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#Apprenticeship> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00008> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#Apprenticeship> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00241> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#Apprenticeship> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_01186> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticeshipAgreement
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticeshipAgreement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticeshipAgreement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#RegulatoryAgreementPattern> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticeshipAgreement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#Contract> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticeshipAgreement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticeshipAgreement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Apprenticeship Agreement" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticeshipAgreement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A complete apprenticeship agreement as defined in the regulatory provision" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticeshipAgreement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A contract between an apprentice and their employer for an apprenticeship" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticeshipAgreement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A contract of apprenticeship under which an apprentice is employed to learn a trade or profession." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticeshipAgreement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A contract of employment or a written statement of particulars under the Employment Rights Act 1996, which takes the form of an apprenticeship agreement." .
