<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#BreakInLearning> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Break in Learning" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#BreakInLearning> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A formal pause in a learner's training programme, recorded by the provider when no off-the-job training active learning is planned within a specified period." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#BreakInLearning> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A formal pause in a learner's training programme, recorded by the provider." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#BreakInLearning> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A period during which active learning is suspended." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#BreakInLearning> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A period during which an apprentice is on a break from their learning." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#BreakInLearning> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A period during which an apprentice's learning is formally paused, typically used when no off-the-job training active learning is planned within a calendar month." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#BreakInLearning> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A status indicating that an apprentice's learning has been temporarily paused." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#BreakInLearning> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "When an individual takes a break of at least a clear calendar month from their apprenticeship but plans to return to it in the future." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#BreakInLearning> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_01192> .
