<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CareLeaversBursary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Care Leavers Bursary" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CareLeaversBursary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Care Leavers' Bursary" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CareLeaversBursary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Care Leavers’ Bursary" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CareLeaversBursary> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A bursary available to learners who have been in care." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CareLeaversBursary> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A bursary provided to care leaver apprentices to support their training costs." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CareLeaversBursary> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A bursary provided to care leavers to support their apprenticeship." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CareLeaversBursary> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A bursary provided to eligible apprentices who are care leavers, as defined in paragraphs 108 and 110 of the relevant regulation." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CareLeaversBursary> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A bursary specifically for care leavers participating in apprenticeships." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CareLeaversBursary> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A one-off financial bursary provided to eligible care leaver apprentices." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CareLeaversBursary> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A tax-free payment to acknowledge the additional financial burden that care leavers encounter when living in, or leaving, care, and not treated as income in Universal Credit calculations." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CareLeaversBursary> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Care leavers’ bursary is an additional £3,000 payment (paid in 3 instalments) that we pay to apprentices who are in care or are care leavers, and who started their apprenticeship training on or after 1" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CareLeaversBursary> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_01193> .
