<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CareLeaversBursaryPayment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A final bursary payment for care leavers on apprenticeship standards with a published typical duration of less than 12 months, and for foundation apprenticeships." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CareLeaversBursaryPayment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A final bursary payment for care leavers, confirmed for apprenticeship standards with a published typical duration of less than 12 months and for foundation apprenticeships." .
