# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestment
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Co-Investment" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Co-investment" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Mandatory Co-investment" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A financial contribution paid by the receiving employer to the main provider for apprenticeship training costs when levy funds are insufficient or exhausted." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Any mandatory co-investment due for training or end-point assessment already delivered." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Co-investment is where the government shares the cost of training and assessing apprentices with employers. For apprenticeship training that started on or after 1 April 2019, employers (who either do not pay the levy or levy payers who have run out of levy funds) pay 5% towards the cost of apprenticeship training. The government will pay the rest (95%) up to the funding band maximum." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The matching co-investment amount collected from employers by main providers for apprenticeships." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestment> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_01194> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestmentAmount
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestmentAmount> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestmentAmount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestmentAmount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Co-Investment Amount" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestmentAmount> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The relevant amount of the total negotiated price, up to the funding band maximum, towards the cost of apprenticeship training and assessment." .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestmentPercentage
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CoInvestmentPercentage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
