<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CompletionPayment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A payment made to a main provider upon completion of apprenticeship training, as described in paragraph 161." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CompletionPayment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Completion payment is a payment we make to providers when an apprentice completes all their learning and undertakes the end-point assessment (the apprentice does not need to pass). This payment is 20% of either the total negotiated price or the funding band maximum, whichever is lower." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#CompletionPayment> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_01195> .
