# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Role> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Costs Definition" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Defined Term" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fees Retained and Charges Definition" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Main providers and employer-providers" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Mentoring" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Costs include any co-investment or additional training and assessment costs above the funding band, that the employer has paid directly to the provider, where this is part of the agreed apprenticeship." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Main providers and employer-providers receiving funding for delivering apprenticeship training and on-programme assessment in England" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mentoring must meet the definition of off-the-job training (new learning, relevant to the apprenticeship, not English and maths, delivered within normal working hours) and be documented in the training plan. The mentor must be a more senior or experienced member of staff. This does not include general line management. The apprentice must not be doing productive work." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The full range of fees retained by the provider and charges (which must be eligible costs) that apply, including funding retained for managing quality assurance / oversight and for administrative functions such as data returns." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "These rules form part of the terms and conditions for the use of funds in an employer’s apprenticeship service account or for government-employer co-investment." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00005> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00013> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00715> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00777> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#DefinedTerm> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_01209> .
