<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerMentoringCost> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Costs of an employer supporting or mentoring an apprentice, where this is required by the standard and part of the agreed training plan." .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerNonLevyPayer
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerNonLevyPayer> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
