# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerProvider
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerProvider> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerProvider> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Agent> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerProvider> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Organisation> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerProvider> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Role> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerProvider> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Employer Provider" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerProvider> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Employer-Provider" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerProvider> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Employer-provider" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerProvider> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An employer-provider is a levy-paying organisation that is on the ‘employer-provider’ route of the Apprenticeship Provider and Assessment Register (APAR)." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerProvider> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An organisation that acts as an employer-provider, required to hold but not publish subcontracting information." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerProvider> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An organisation that acts as both an employer and a training provider for apprentices." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerProvider> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An organisation that acts as both the employer of an apprentice and the provider of their training." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerProvider> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An organisation that both employs an apprentice and provides their training." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerProvider> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An organisation that provides apprenticeship training and employs the apprentice." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerProvider> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "We use the term ‘employer-provider’ where the funding rule only applies to a levy-paying organisation that is listed on the employer-provider route of the APAR. Employer-providers can only deliver apprenticeship training to their own staff or those of a connected company or charity and must do so on an actual cost basis (see paragraph 102)." .
