<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#OTJTActiveLearningPlan> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A plan for off-the-job training active learning to take place at least every 3 calendar months of the practical period." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#OTJTActiveLearningPlan> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A plan for off-the-job training active learning to take place at least in every calendar month of the practical period." .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#OTJTMinimumRequirement
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#OTJTMinimumRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
