<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#NotaryPublic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Role> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#NotaryPublic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Notary Public" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#NotaryPublic> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A role of a person authorized to perform certain legal formalities, especially to witness signatures on documents." .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsAvailableIncome
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsAvailableIncome> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsAvailableIncome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#FinancialNeedAssessmentInputPattern> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsAvailableIncome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsAvailableIncome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Parents' Available Income" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsAvailableIncome> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Parents' available income is calculated by subtracting certain allowances from the parents' total income. These allowances account for certain nondiscretionary expenses, such as taxes and basic living expenses. Once a minimum level of support has been offset for those expenses, the formula assumes that the remaining income is available for discretionary purposes, including paying for a postsecondary education. The available income can be a negative number." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsAvailableIncome> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00179> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContribution
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContribution> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContribution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#FinancialNeedAssessmentInputPattern> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContribution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContribution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Parents' Contribution" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContribution> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The calculated amount representing the portion of parental income and assets considered available to help pay for the student's college education, as determined under the 2025-26 Student Aid Index (SAI) and Pell Grant Eligibility Guide." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContribution> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00184> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContributionFromAssets
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContributionFromAssets> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContributionFromAssets> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto#FinancialNeedAssessmentInputPattern> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContributionFromAssets> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContributionFromAssets> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Parents Contribution from Assets" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContributionFromAssets> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A calculated amount representing the contribution from the assets of parents of a dependent student, determined by adding cash, savings, checking, time deposits, money market funds, net worth of investments, and adjusted net worth of business and/or investment farm." .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsTotalIncome
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsTotalIncome> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsTotalIncome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
