<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsTotalIncome> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The total income of parents as calculated for student aid purposes, subject to offsets and allowances defined in regulation." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsTotalIncome> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00181> .
