<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#AUS_UNIT_00786_action_17cbde> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasActionExpression> "After the approval of revocation, you must meet the following requirements: complete teaching all current VSL students before progressing a request for voluntary revocation; provide periodic reports on VSL students if required; provide written notice to the VSL Tuition Protection Director of the circumstances of a default within 24 hours of the default occurring; confirm that your organisation either has no VSL students or has advised the department and the students of the measures it will take to afford students tuition protection." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#AUS_UNIT_00786_action_17cbde> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Meet Administrative Requirements" .
