<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00394_condition_76575f> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasConditionExpression> "Students with dependent children aged 18 or under are eligible. If a student also has dependent children in post-secondary study, the student’s children will be considered in the need assessment up to the age of 22. Foster children may also be included as dependants. The age of the dependent child or children is calculated as of the study period start date in the year in which the study period begins." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00394_condition_76575f> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Age and Study Conditions" .
