<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00402_condition_440e18> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasConditionExpression> "These costs are subject to a weekly maximum amount equal to the weekly dependent child/relative allowance as established by the Canada Student Financial Assistance Program. See Chapter 14, Table 3. For married students or common-law students, if the spouse will also be a full-time student for at least 12 weeks during the applicant’s study period, this amount will be divided in half." .
