<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00432_action_03035d> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasActionExpression> "Parent(s) living outside Canada are expected to complete Appendix 1 by indicating their income as reported on their previous year’s Canadian T1 General Income Tax and Benefit Return, and all out-of-country income from all sources as well as all Canadian and foreign assets." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00432_action_03035d> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Complete Appendix 1 Income Reporting" .
