<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00437_action_ee98a6> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasActionExpression> "Parental expected contribution from assets is calculated as one percent of the total net value of all eligible assets (excluding RRSPs, motor vehicles, principal residence and business/farm), in excess of a standard exemption of $150,000. Divide this by the number of the parents’ dependants who are attending post-secondary studies." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00437_action_ee98a6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Calculate Parental Asset Contribution" .
