<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00453_object_fc93f4> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The amount of student financial assistance available to a student is limited by the minimum and maximum interest free loan award amounts set by the Canada Student Financial Assistance Program and by StudentAid BC. The student’s award is based on the federal and provincial need assessments and eligibility for non-repayable federal and provincial grants and bursaries." .
