<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00502_action_a43432> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00502_action_a43432> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00502_action_a43432> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Action> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00502_action_a43432> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasActionExpression> "The student does not attend any instructional hours for two consecutive calendar weeks; attends less than 12 hours per week (or less than 8 hours per week for students with a disability) for three consecutive calendar weeks; and/or is absent for sufficient hours/days that the post-secondary institution determines that the student cannot successfully complete the program." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00502_action_a43432> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Non-Attendance Action" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00502_action_a43432> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00502> .
