<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00886_condition_59e954> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasConditionExpression> "If the borrower is approved as having a permanent disability, all RAP applications beginning with the current RAP period will be processed under RAP-D. Borrowers who have been approved as having a persistent or prolonged disability may be required to re-verify their disability status to maintain eligibility for RAP-D on subsequent applications." .
