# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00545_condition_cef982
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00545_condition_cef982> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00545_condition_cef982> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00545_condition_cef982> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Condition> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00545_condition_cef982> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasConditionExpression> "Before any payment is claimed for and paid there is confirmation of eligibility for any additional payment and / or care leaver bursary. This includes (1) confirmation of age; (2) a signed letter or email confirmation from a local authority confirming the individual’s care leaver status (this does not require a particular format); or (3) evidence of an education, health and care (EHC) plan where the apprentice is aged between 19 and 24 years old (Local Authority confirmation does not require a particular format; main providers should assist the apprentice in obtaining confirmation where necessary)." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00545_condition_cef982> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Pre-Payment Condition" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00545_condition_cef982> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00545> .
