<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00827_action_2bbed7> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasActionExpression> "The provider must manage and monitor all of their subcontractors to ensure that high-quality delivery is taking place that meets the requirements of the agreement they have entered into with us for the provision of apprenticeship funded delivery (which must comply with the apprenticeship funding rules). The provider must ensure safeguarding is rigorously enforced." .
