<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00186_subject_f18612> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00186_subject_f18612> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Student Available Income" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00186_subject_f18612> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The student's available income is calculated by subtracting certain allowances from the student's total income. These allowances account for certain nondiscretionary expenses, such as taxes and basic living expenses. Once a minimum level of support has been offset for those expenses, the formula assumes that the remaining income is available for discretionary purposes, including paying for a postsecondary education. The student's available income is the sum of the taxable and untaxed income, minus amounts reported in the income but excluded from the formula (offsets and allowances)." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00186_subject_f18612> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00186> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Source: USA-UNIT-00188" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188_calculation_rule
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188_calculation_rule> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188_calculation_rule> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188_calculation_rule> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Condition> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188_calculation_rule> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasConditionExpression> "Student's total income = Student's total income - (Student's taxable college grant and scholarship aid + Student's education credits + Student's Federal Work-Study) - (U.S. income tax paid + Student's payroll tax allowance + Income protection allowance + Allowance for parents' negative adjusted available income)" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188_calculation_rule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Student Income Calculation Rule" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188_calculation_rule> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The student's total income is decreased by the sum of income offsets (taxable college grant and scholarship aid, education credits, Federal Work-Study) and reduced by the sum of income allowances (U.S. income tax paid, payroll tax allowance, income protection allowance, allowance for parents' negative adjusted available income)." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188_calculation_rule> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188_income_allowances_condition
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188_income_allowances_condition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188_income_allowances_condition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188_income_allowances_condition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Condition> .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188_income_allowances_condition> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasConditionExpression> "The sum of the following allowances reduces the student's total income: U.S. income tax paid, Student's payroll tax allowance, Income protection allowance, Allowance for parents' negative adjusted available income." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188_income_allowances_condition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Income Allowances Condition" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188_income_allowances_condition> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188> .
