<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188_income_offsets_condition> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasConditionExpression> "The sum of the following items decreases the student's total income: Student's taxable college grant and scholarship aid, Student's education credits, Student's Federal Work-Study (FWS)." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00188_income_offsets_condition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Income Offsets Condition" .
