<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00206_condition_networth> <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasConditionExpression> "Net worth is calculated by adding cash, savings, checking, time deposits, money market funds, net worth of investments, and adjusted net worth of business/farm." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00206_condition_networth> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Net Worth Calculation Step" .
