<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#FinancialAidAdministrator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Financial Aid Administrator" .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#FinancialAidAdministrator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A role held by an FAA who may use professional judgment to count a benefit." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#FinancialAidAdministrator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A role responsible for administering financial aid at an institution, including making dependency override determinations." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#FinancialAidAdministrator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A role responsible for administering financial aid programs, including making professional judgment decisions." .
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#FinancialAidAdministrator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A role responsible for processing student financial aid requests and determinations." .
